{{Item|Fossil Essence}} is an [[Essence]]. It is primarily used in the {{Zone|glacite tunnels}}.

== Obtaining ==
{{Item|Fossil Essence}} can be be obtained in the {{Zone|glacite tunnels}} and {{Zone|glacite mineshafts}} in multiple ways:
* [[Fossil Excavator]]
* Mining Fossils (which appear as [[Quartz]] blocks, stairs, and slabs) in {{zone|Glacite Mineshafts}}, rewarding {{Green|4}}-{{Green|8}} each.
* Collecting {{NPCSprite|Dr. Stone}}'s rewards.
* Collecting {{NPCSprite|Fossil Muncher}}'s rewards.
* [[Salvaging#Fossil|Salvaging]] certain items.

=== Increasing Fossil Essence Gain ===
{{Item|Peridot Gemstone}}s can be applied to a [[Chisel]] to increase {{Item|Fossil Essence}} gain from the [[Fossil Excavator]] by {{Green|30%}}-{{Green|100%}} per gemstone, up to {{Green|300%}} with {{Item|Perfect Peridot Gemstone|amount=3}}s on a {{Item|Perfect Chisel}}.

